------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Protocol Implementations
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The SMB, LLMNR, NBT-NS, mDNS, and NTLM code in this repository was written from
Microsoft and IETF protocol specifications.

The name-poisoning listeners provide functionality comparable to Responder
(https://github.com/lgandx/Responder). No Responder source code is used or
derived from here: Responder is distributed under the GPL-3.0, which is not
compatible with this project's BSD 2-Clause license. These listeners were
implemented independently from the published wire formats of LLMNR (RFC 4795),
NBT-NS (RFC 1001/1002), and mDNS (RFC 6762). Where flag names or output
conventions resemble Responder's, that is for operator familiarity and does not
constitute use of its source.
